{"id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-transitive.md","title":"Transitive Set","display":"df-transitive — Transitive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transitive","aliases":["58-df-transitive","Transitive Set"],"display":"df-transitive — Transitive Set","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-membership.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transitive</span><span>Transitive Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transitive — Transitive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e9ab8b3f0cb5f0a\" href=\"?note=8e9ab8b3f0cb5f0a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-membership.md\">../batch14/58-df-membership.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Transitive}(X) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall y\\;(y \\in X \\to y \\subseteq X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\mathrm{Transitive}(X) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall y\\;(y \\in X \\to y \\subseteq X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>传递集</strong>: 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in X\">\\(y \\in X\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 的所有元素也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的元素</li>\n<li><strong>传递闭包</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}(X)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}(X)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}X^{(n)}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{(0)}=X\">\\(X^{(0)}=X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{(n+1)}=X^{(n)}\\cup\\bigcup X^{(n)}\">\\(X^{(n+1)}=X^{(n)}\\cup\\bigcup X^{(n)}\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>传递模型</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 传递且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\models \\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(M \\models \\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>基础公理 (Foundation)</strong>: 每个非空集合都有一个与该集合不相交的元素；特别地排除无限下降的隶属链。</li>\n<li><strong>Mostowski 崩塌</strong>: 每个良基且外延的关系都有唯一的传递集崩塌。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 6 (Inner Models)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-membership.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e9ab8b3f0cb5f0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../bat